        "Id1": {
            "text": "The Bedford Aerodrome has an operating organization that is called the MotorSport Vision. It is located in Thurleigh. Its runway is named as \"08/26\" and its length is 1095. The ICAO location identifier is EGBF, and this aerodrome serves the Bedford Autodrome."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The Bedford Aerodrome in Thurleigh serving the Bedford Autodrome, operated by MotorSport Vision, has a runway named 08/26 that has the runway length of 1095. The ICAO location identifier for the Bedford Aerodrome is EGBF."
