            "text": "Bedford Aerodrome is located in Thurleigh. This airport serves the Bedford Autodrome and is operated by MotorSport Vision. The runway, called 08/26, is 1095 meters long. The ICAO location identifier for Bedford Aerodrome is EGBF."
